{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 12, "text": "谈爬山\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n128）\n谈爬山\n爬山是抗大课程表外的必修科目，在锻炼抗日的干部上，有着很大的意义。锻炼了每个青年的体力，锻炼出民族战士的艰苦奋斗的作风，而且是直接连系到战场的实践教育。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-3b2a4f773bd45df70031", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-129.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "4945e9b31304c0e5fa1e126cf1537c4083da5a24575b424dbfc75365885f83b7", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 2, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e20326c4c0699e952654c73fb5ec23694efb9bf04113ce6532ee79446a43d9b7", "text_chars": 138}
